            "name": "fileManagerMenuHelp",
            "rect": [
                560,
                229,
                24,
                24
            ],
            "text": "Adds Upload with put.gd to the right-click menu of the file managers on this computer: Files (Scripts), Dolphin, Nemo, Thunar (Send To), Caja (Scripts), PCManFM, Pantheon Files and COSMIC Files. Turning it off removes only the entries this AppImage wrote."
        },
        {
            "checkable": true,
            "checked": true,
            "class": "QCheckBox",
            "enabled": false,
            "kind": "button",
            "name": "fileManagerMenu",
            "rect": [
                968,
                224,
                24,
                36
            ],
            "text": "Add Upload with put.gd to the right-click menu"
        },
        {
            "checkable": true,
            "checked": false,
            "class": "QToolButton",
            "enabled": true,
            "kind": "button",
            "name": "fileManagerFoldersHelp",
            "rect": [
                315,
                303,
                24,
                24
            ],
            "text": "How a folder you choose Upload with put.gd for is uploaded. Upload as a .zip makes one <folder name>.zip with everything inside it, and copies one link. Upload each file uploads every file in it and its subfolders, one link each; symbolic links are skipped, and the file limit under Advanced (100 by default, up to 10,000) counts every file, so a large folder needs a .zip or a higher limit."
        },
        {
            "class": "QComboBox",
            "count": 2,
            "enabled": true,
            "kind": "choice",
            "name": "fileManagerFolders",
            "rect": [
                528,
